:: encounter.alley-mugging-approach -> @exit
  @auto enter-place
  @place-key alleyway
  @when not flags.encounter.alley_mugging_seen and player.money >= 20
  @priority 500
  @onenter
    @effect set flags.encounter.alley_mugging_seen
  @endonenter

  A stranger steps into your path and demands your money.

  @choicegroup ""

    @choice "No way!" -> encounter.alley-mugging
      @response
        You refuse to hand over your money. The mugger steps closer, and the confrontation becomes physical.
      @endresponse
    @endchoice

    @choice "Hand over the money" -> encounter.alley-jackie-introduction
      @change money -20
      @response
        You hand over what the mugger demands. Once they have the money, they hurry away.
      @endresponse
    @endchoice

    @choice "Run for the street"
      @check skill fitness easy
      @success -> encounter.alley-jackie-introduction
        @response
          You outrun the mugger and reach the mouth of the alley before they give up the chase.
        @endresponse
      @endsuccess
      @failure -> encounter.alley-mugging
        @response
          The mugger catches you before you can reach the street. You turn to face them as the confrontation becomes physical.
        @endresponse
      @endfailure
    @endchoice

  @endchoicegroup

:: encounter.alley-mugging -> encounter.alley-jackie-introduction
  @actor mugger civilian

  @system encounter.physical {"scenario":"fight","opponent":{"id":"mugger","actor":"mugger"},"goal":{"id":"steal-money","maxAmount":20},"outcomes":{"player-rescued":{"target":"encounter.alley-mugging-rescue","leavePlace":false},"default":{"target":"encounter.alley-jackie-introduction","leavePlace":false}}}

:: encounter.alley-mugging-rescue -> encounter.alley-jackie-introduction
  @actor rescuer civilian

  Your scream carries beyond the alley. A nearby {{actor.rescuer.noun}} rushes toward you, shouting that help is coming.

  The interruption is enough. The mugger releases you and runs before {{actor.rescuer.subject}} can reach the fight. Once the attacker is gone, the {{actor.rescuer.noun}} stays with you and makes sure you are safe.

  @next "Thank them"

:: encounter.alley-jackie-introduction -> encounter.alley-jackie-coaching
  @auto enter-place
  @place-key alleyway
  @priority 400
  @when not npc.jackie.met

  @onenter
    @effect teleport npc jackie player
    @effect relationship jackie.rapport 1
    @effect set flags.encounter.jackie_met
  @endonenter

  @if flags.encounter.alley_mugging_seen
    Once the danger has passed, someone who had been watching from farther down the alley approaches you.

    "Name's {{npc.jackie.shortName}}," {{npc.jackie.shortName}} says. "You kept your head better than most people would. Your technique could use some work, though."
  @else
    A figure steps out of the shadows and into the alley. {{npc.jackie.shortName}} is dressed in a loose hoodie and jeans.
    "Nice to see ya," {{npc.jackie.shortName}} says. "I don't think we've met, but name's {{npc.jackie.shortName}}. You look like you could use a hand with your self-defense skills."
  @endif

  Jackie explains that this alley is usually where you can find {{npc.jackie.object}}, then offers to coach you through a few kinds of fight.

  @next "Hear {{npc.jackie.object}} out"

:: encounter.alley-jackie-coaching -> @exit
  @heading "Training with Jackie"
  @choices "Choose a drill"

  @if player.conditionScore < 45 or player.pain >= 50
    Jackie looks you over, then shakes {{npc.jackie.dependent}} head. "Not today. You're already too hurt for this to be useful. Get some rest, then come back."
  @else
    Jackie rolls {{npc.jackie.dependent}} shoulders and gives you enough room to prepare. "Pick the situation. I'll play the aggressor, and you find a way through it."
  @endif

  @choice "Try to rob me" -> encounter.alley-jackie-theft-practice
    @when player.conditionScore >= 45 and player.pain < 50
    @change money 5
    @effect set daily.npc.jackie.training
    @response
      Jackie hands you £5. "Protect that or get away and it's yours. I'll try to take it back."
    @endresponse
  @endchoice

  @choice "Try to hurt me" -> encounter.alley-jackie-beat-down-practice
    @when player.conditionScore >= 45 and player.pain < 50
    @effect set daily.npc.jackie.training
  @endchoice

  @choice "Not right now" -> @exit
    @when player.conditionScore >= 45 and player.pain < 50
  @endchoice

  @choice "Take Jackie's advice" -> @exit
    @when player.conditionScore < 45 or player.pain >= 50
  @endchoice

:: encounter.alley-jackie-theft-practice -> place.alleyway
  @system encounter.physical {"scenario":"fight","opponent":{"id":"jackie","npc":"jackie"},"goal":{"id":"steal-money","maxAmount":5},"outcomes":{"default":{"target":"place.alleyway","leavePlace":false}}}

:: encounter.alley-jackie-beat-down-practice -> place.alleyway
  @system encounter.physical {"scenario":"fight","opponent":{"id":"jackie","npc":"jackie"},"goal":{"id":"beat-down"},"outcomes":{"default":{"target":"place.alleyway","leavePlace":false}}}

:: place.alleyway
  @hub alleyway
  @choices "In the alley"

  The narrow alley is hemmed in by brick walls, bins, fire escapes, and the distant noise of the street.

  @if npc.jackie.met and npc.jackie.present
    Jackie is nearby, in the shadows of the alley.

    @random
      {{npc.jackie.subject | cap}} seems to be repeatedly throwing a rubber ball against the wall and catching it.
    @or
      {{npc.jackie.subject | cap}} is practicing a series of punches in the air, moving with a rhythm that is almost like a dance.
    @or
      {{npc.jackie.subject | cap}} is leaning against the wall, arms crossed, and watching you with a faintly amused expression.
    @or
      {{npc.jackie.subject | cap}} is crouched down, examining the ground as if looking for something. {{npc.jackie.subject | cap}} looks up when you approach.
    @or
      {{npc.jackie.subject | cap}} is sitting on a crate, stretching {{npc.jackie.dependent}} legs and rolling {{npc.jackie.dependent}} shoulders.
    @endrandom
  @endif

  @choice "Train with Jackie" -> encounter.alley-jackie-coaching
    @when npc.jackie.met and npc.jackie.present and not daily.npc.jackie.training
  @endchoice

   @choice "Train with Jackie" -> place.alleyway
    @when npc.jackie.met and npc.jackie.present and daily.npc.jackie.training
    @response
      "Easy there tiger," Jackie says. "I think we've done enough training for today. Let's pick this up again tomorrow."
    @endresponse
  @endchoice
